  step,dige:8b9e9c9698a3828b
  step=2,desc:six stones from plain objects — the producer names each one by its own id,dige:f1c13e2d08e6dd7d
  step=3,desc:stand the stones as foam with no hand on them — each rests where the pile puts it,dige:5e11a2bbcfd0706e
  step=4,desc:the hand puts two stones — chert pinned low left and jade drawn toward the high right,dige:e65e62249cb573f9
    Assertion:a-pinned-put-sits,sentence:a pinned put sits exactly where the hand put it
    Assertion:an-attracted-put-falls,sentence:an attracted put falls toward its place — nearer than it rested free — and its neighbours still press
  step=5,desc:tear the glass down and stand it fresh — the producer hands over the same puts,dige:af5be2094358e425
    Assertion:a-glass-torn-down,sentence:a glass torn down and stood fresh is put back exactly as the hand left it
  step=6,desc:the hand lifts — the producer hands over no puts and the stones go free,dige:a83c53aede49cd01
    Assertion:lifting-the-hand-frees,sentence:lifting the hand frees the stone and the put rows leave the world
